# Local TextFSM template index for the SSH runner.
#
# Format matches ntc-templates upstream:
#   Template, Hostname, Platform, Command
#
# Templates here override upstream when both ship a template for the
# same (Platform, Command) pair — flow_weaver_ssh_parsers walks this
# file before the upstream index. Add new entries below in alphabetical
# order by Platform, then by Command, to keep merges sane.
#
# `sh[[ow]]` is index shorthand for `sh(ow)?` — the `[[ ... ]]` group
# is an optional suffix.

Template, Hostname, Platform, Command

nokia_srl_show_version.textfsm, .*, nokia_srl, sh[[ow]] ver[[sion]]
nokia_srl_show_version.textfsm, .*, nokia_srl, info from state system information
